Hi Admiral,

  I have installed SuSE 6.3 AXP on a Multia. It was problematic as the
SuSE CDs are broken for the Multia Machine. The method was:
- get the VMLINUX Image with TGA Support from SuSE support, and put it
on the installation floppy
- use ARC to boot the floppies
- install the Linux Software. Do not shut down.
- now create a new kernel (with NCR SCSI and TGA support)
- copy this kernel to /boot
there you go.
 
Peter


